# Docker build context of the Fripon Cloud image (the context is this folder, see server/Dockerfile).
# The image needs the server and the extension modules it bundles from lib/, nothing else:
# everything is excluded first, then those two folders come back.
*
!lib/
!server/

# Inside them, what the image never reads.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.wxt
**/coverage
**/*.test.ts
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
server/data
server/Dockerfile
server/compose.yml
server/caddy
server/scripts
